{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_C0A5E4BE","title":"Take Ma Gomba's Mushroom Order","entry":"Dlg_C0A5E4BE::entry","exit":"Dlg_C0A5E4BE::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_EB66D915","articyId":"72057611218072385","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"Ah, my little Agaricus. How nice. I was expecting the bad tempered trug-lugger.","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ah, my little Agaricus. How nice. I was expecting the bad tempered trug-lugger.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":425.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36102","byteOffset":28005040,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_D0EC3BB7","articyId":"72057611218072400","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"Well, this is a surprise. I was expecting that bad tempered trug-lugger.","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, this is a surprise. I was expecting that bad tempered trug-lugger.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":425.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21637","byteOffset":16076144,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_9B21FA57","articyId":"72057611218072415","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"I suppose I do. Such a tiresome individual. All mud and ethics. No... adaptability.","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I suppose I do. Such a tiresome individual. All mud and ethics. No... adaptability.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1050.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48503","byteOffset":32684480,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_24B4CC67","articyId":"72057611218072429","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"In order to bloom, symbiosis is necessary, if distasteful. And “Clem” has the best substrate in the city.","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"In order to bloom, symbiosis is necessary, if distasteful. And “Clem” has the best substrate in the city.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1637.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27188","byteOffset":18163912,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_0FEC19C0","articyId":"72057611218072461","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"Indeed. I’m holding a soiree for some associates. We have a little wager going. I wish to show them the difference in quality between my mushrooms and those grown by… let’s say an enthusiastic amateur.","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Indeed. I’m holding a soiree for some associates. We have a little wager going. I wish to show them the difference in quality between my mushrooms and those grown by… let’s say an enthusiastic amateur.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2275.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31015","byteOffset":19615672,"byteLength":516}},{"id":"DFr_E20E9E53","articyId":"72057611218072476","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"You are a quick one, aren't you?","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You are a quick one, aren't you?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2874.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21843","byteOffset":16152720,"byteLength":376}},{"id":"DFr_CE867EAB","articyId":"72057611218072502","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"Take the job, or leave it. It means little to me.","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Take the job, or leave it. It means little to me.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":4675.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27174","byteOffset":18158544,"byteLength":360}},{"id":"DFr_38600610","articyId":"72057611218072509","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"Excellent. I want some Kings. 5 units should do it. That's simple enough even for you, button.","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Excellent. I want some Kings. 5 units should do it. That's simple enough even for you, button.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3450.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35057","byteOffset":25623104,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_BD8D9691","articyId":"72057611218072523","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"I'm sure you will.","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm sure you will.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":4025.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21345","byteOffset":15962336,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_07AF1805","articyId":"72057611218072554","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"Working for me should be payment enough. Perhaps I'll give you something more. It will depend on the quality of your fungi.","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Working for me should be payment enough. Perhaps I'll give you something more. It will depend on the quality of your fungi.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4025.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47290","byteOffset":32226176,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_9710C53A","articyId":"72057611218072407","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You mean Clem?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You mean Clem?","TextSheVersion":"You mean Clem?","TextTheyVersion":"You mean Clem?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":750.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41691","byteOffset":30101304,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_ECB046A1","articyId":"72057611218072422","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"If you don’t like Clem, why do business?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If you don’t like Clem, why do business?","TextSheVersion":"If you don’t like Clem, why do business?","TextTheyVersion":"If you don’t like Clem, why do business?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1350.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30100","byteOffset":19266624,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_087B4A73","articyId":"72057611218072436","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Good job I'm here then.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Good job I'm here then.","TextSheVersion":"Good job I'm here then.","TextTheyVersion":"Good job I'm here then."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1350.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25146","byteOffset":17394760,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_3996541A","articyId":"72057611218072454","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Let me guess, you have a mushroom order?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Let me guess, you have a mushroom order?","TextSheVersion":"Let me guess, you have a mushroom order?","TextTheyVersion":"Let me guess, you have a mushroom order?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1924.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30113","byteOffset":19271664,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_B10B2A2B","articyId":"72057611218072469","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You want me to grow mushrooms just so you can judge them?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You want me to grow mushrooms just so you can judge them?","TextSheVersion":"You want me to grow mushrooms just so you can judge them?","TextTheyVersion":"You want me to grow mushrooms just so you can judge them?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2587.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28816","byteOffset":18784632,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_0E15A1C6","articyId":"72057611218072483","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"A job’s a job. I’ll do it.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"A job’s a job. I’ll do it.","TextSheVersion":"A job’s a job. I’ll do it.","TextTheyVersion":"A job’s a job. I’ll do it."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3175.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","p